\ A three-deep chain of tail calls ending in a raising non-generic native. The interpreter
\ elides the tail frames, so only the non-tail top-level call renders a row. The eager and AOT
\ runs must elide the same frames; the AOT suite builds this file through a `.source` redirect
\ and diffs the same golden.

inner: ( s v -- n ) [ stream-write ] ;
outer: ( s v -- n ) [ inner ] ;

stdout 42 outer .
